flowchart TD
    A[Start] --> B[Prepare select account_number and balance by user]
    B --> C[Open DB connection]
    C --> D[Bind user ID]
    D --> E[Execute query]
    E --> F{More rows?}
    F -- Yes --> G[Append accountNo,balance string to list]
    G --> E
    F -- No --> H[Return list]
    C --> I[On SQL error print stack trace]
    I --> H
    H --> J[End]
